    "preamble": "Syed Sohel Syed Mehmood vs The Commissioner Of Police Aurangabad ... on 15 May, 2024 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad Anticipatory Bail Application No. 734 Of 2024 Syed Sohel Syed Mehmood Versus The Commissioner Of Police Aurangabad And Another Mr. A. R. Borulkar, Advocate for the Applicant Mr. V. M. Kagane, App for the Respondents/State Coram : R. M. Joshi, J. (Vacation Court) Dated : 15th May, 2024 Per Court :- 1. Heard. 2.",
    "facts": "The learned counsel for the applicant submits that the contraband articles i.e. gutkha, panmasala are already seized and nothing is to be recovered at the instance of the Applicant.",
